   "Evangeeia is covered against what it is likely to face, with little left over; two troubles at once would be too many.",
   "Weak▼",
   "Food endurance: The siege has taken the outlying fields; with what is still harvested, the granary carries the city for about a month at full rations, about three months on half.",
   "Nobody in Evangeeia thinks of the city walls and gates as ornament; the city knows what it is for and checks it.",
   "Weak"
  ],
